Certainly.  Especially as a lawful and/or post-Quest/post-Ludios
character.

> And in the same vein: what do you (usually) do when you
> encounter a shop?

Early in the game I price ID some items mostly looking for what
costs a little and what costs a lot - ID scrolls vs the very expensive
ones, the types of lamp and such.  I also use my pet to rob items
and/or gold from shops - tripe or magic whistle make this easier
but it works without.

By the time I've finished Ft Ludios or post-Quest I have enough
gold that I use the gold to buy any item that strikes my fancy
in any shop.  Early on gold is good for protection, later shopping
is one of its few remaining good uses.


